    "name": "DeepPath",
    "description": "The model introduced is a novel reinforcement learning framework designed for learning multi-hop relational paths in large scale knowledge graphs (KGs). It operates using a policy-based agent with continuous states based on knowledge graph embeddings, reasoning within a KG vector space by sampling the most promising relation to extend its path. A distinguishing feature of this approach is its reward function, which takes accuracy, diversity, and efficiency into consideration.",
